<section aria-labelledby="problem-heading" class="px-6 pt-16">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="relative rounded-3xl p-10 md:p-16 overflow-hidden bg-[#1a0f3d]">
      <div class="absolute -top-32 right-0 w-[500px] h-[400px] bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,rgba(48,27,105,0.4),transparent_70%)]" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl">
        <h2 id="problem-heading" class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
          You're answering the same questions.<br />Every. Single. Day.
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-white/70 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Your support team handles 80% repeat queries. Customers message at 2am and get silence. New hires spend their first week asking senior people for things that should be in a doc. Sales prospects ask pricing questions nobody is around to answer.
          </p>
          <p>
            You don't need more staff. You need an agent that knows your business cold — and handles it for you, 24/7.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
